) VALUES (
    'holmenkollen-venue-guide',
    '{"en": "Holmenkollen: The Cathedral of Nordic Skiing", "de": "Holmenkollen: Die Kathedrale des Nordischen Skisports", "fr": "Holmenkollen : La cathédrale du ski nordique", "it": "Holmenkollen: La cattedrale dello sci nordico", "es": "Holmenkollen: La catedral del esquí nórdico", "pt": "Holmenkollen: A catedral do esqui nórdico", "nl": "Holmenkollen: De kathedraal van de Noordse ski", "ar": "هولمنكولين: كاتدرائية التزلج الشمالي", "ja": "ホルメンコーレン：ノルディックスキーの大聖堂", "zh": "Holmenkollen: Beiou Huaxue de Datang", "ko": "홀멘콜렌: 노르딕 스키의 대성당"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "This iconic Oslo venue has hosted ski jumping for over 130 years. The modernized hill offers spectacular views of the Norwegian capital and continues to draw huge crowds.", "de": "Diese ikonische Osloer Anlage ist seit über 130 Jahren Gastgeber für Skispringen.", "fr": "Ce site emblématique d''Oslo accueille le saut à ski depuis plus de 130 ans.", "it": "Questa iconica sede di Oslo ospita il salto con gli sci da oltre 130 anni.", "es": "Este icónico lugar de Oslo ha albergado salto de esquí durante más de 130 años.", "pt": "Este icônico local de Oslo sediou salto de esqui por mais de 130 anos.", "nl": "Deze iconische locatie in Oslo organiseert al meer dan 130 jaar schansspringen.", "ar": "استضاف هذا الموقع الأيقوني في أوسلو القفز على الجليد لأكثر من 130 عاماً", "ja": "このオスロの象徴的な会場は、130年以上にわたりスキージャンプを開催してきました。", "zh": "Zhe ge Aosilu de biaozhixing changguan yi juxing huaxue tiaoyue chaoguo 130 nian.", "ko": "이 상징적인 오슬로 경기장은 130년 이상 스키점프를 개최해 왔습니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>Holmenkollen stands as the spiritual home of <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">ski jumping</a> and <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">Nordic skiing</a>. Located just outside Oslo, this venue has been central to Norwegian skiing culture for over a century.</p><h2>Historic Significance</h2><p>The first Holmenkollen ski festival was held in 1892, making this one of the oldest ski competitions in the world. The venue has been rebuilt several times, with the current striking modern design completed in 2010.</p><p>For Norwegians, Holmenkollen represents more than a ski hill - it''s a national treasure that embodies their deep connection to winter sports.</p><h2>The Modern Hill</h2><p>The current structure is an architectural marvel, combining functional excellence with dramatic aesthetics. The steel and concrete design offers athletes ideal conditions while providing spectacular viewing for the thousands of fans who attend events.</p><p>Champions like <a href=\"/halvor-granerud-profile/\">Halvor Egner Granerud</a>, <a href=\"/stefan-kraft-profile/\">Stefan Kraft</a>, and <a href=\"/maren-lundby-profile/\">Maren Lundby</a> have flown down this legendary hill.</p><h2>Holmenkollen Ski Festival</h2><p>The annual Holmenkollen Weekend is one of the highlights of the skiing calendar. Cross-country races through the Oslo forests and ski jumping under lights create an atmosphere unlike anywhere else in the sport.</p><p>Norwegian fans are famously passionate, and their support for the home athletes is deafening.</p><h2>Cross-Country Trails</h2><p>The venue also features excellent cross-country skiing facilities. The trails wind through the forests above Oslo, providing challenging terrain for World Cup racing.</p><h2>The View</h2><p>From the top of the hill, athletes and visitors enjoy panoramic views of Oslo, the Oslofjord, and the surrounding forests. The combination of urban accessibility and natural beauty makes Holmenkollen unique.</p><h2>Getting There</h2><p>The venue is easily accessible from central Oslo via the metro (T-bane) Line 1. The journey takes about 30 minutes and offers lovely views of the city.</p>", "de": "<p>Holmenkollen gilt als die geistige Heimat des <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">Skisprungs</a> und des <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">Nordischen Skisports</a>. Außerhalb von Oslo gelegen, ist dieser Austragungsort seit über einem Jahrhundert zentral für die norwegische Skikultur.</p><h2>Historische Bedeutung</h2><p>Das erste Holmenkollen-Skifestival fand 1892 statt.</p><h2>Die moderne Schanze</h2><p>Champions wie <a href=\"/halvor-granerud-profile/\">Halvor Egner Granerud</a> und <a href=\"/stefan-kraft-profile/\">Stefan Kraft</a> sind diese legendäre Schanze hinuntergeflogen.</p><h2>Holmenkollen Ski Festival</h2><p>Das jährliche Holmenkollen-Wochenende ist einer der Höhepunkte des Ski-Kalenders.</p>", "fr": "<p>Holmenkollen est la demeure spirituelle du <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">saut à ski</a> et du <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">ski nordique</a>. Situé juste à l''extérieur d''Oslo, ce site est central dans la culture du ski norvégien depuis plus d''un siècle.</p><h2>Importance historique</h2><p>Le premier festival de ski de Holmenkollen a eu lieu en 1892.</p><h2>Le tremplin moderne</h2><p>Des champions comme <a href=\"/halvor-granerud-profile/\">Halvor Egner Granerud</a> et <a href=\"/stefan-kraft-profile/\">Stefan Kraft</a> ont volé sur ce tremplin légendaire.</p>", "it": "<p>Holmenkollen è la casa spirituale del <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">salto con gli sci</a> e dello <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">sci nordico</a>. Situata appena fuori Oslo, questa sede è stata centrale nella cultura sciistica norvegese per oltre un secolo.</p><h2>Significato storico</h2><p>Il primo festival sciistico di Holmenkollen si tenne nel 1892.</p><h2>Il trampolino moderno</h2><p>Campioni come <a href=\"/halvor-granerud-profile/\">Halvor Egner Granerud</a> hanno volato su questo trampolino leggendario.</p>", "es": "<p>Holmenkollen es el hogar espiritual del <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">salto de esquí</a> y del <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">esquí nórdico</a>. Ubicado a las afueras de Oslo, este lugar ha sido central en la cultura del esquí noruego durante más de un siglo.</p><h2>Significado histórico</h2><p>El primer festival de esquí de Holmenkollen se celebró en 1892.</p>", "pt": "<p>Holmenkollen é o lar espiritual do <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">salto de esqui</a> e do <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">esqui nórdico</a>. Localizado nos arredores de Oslo, este local tem sido central na cultura do esqui norueguês por mais de um século.</p><h2>Significado histórico</h2><p>O primeiro festival de esqui de Holmenkollen foi realizado em 1892.</p>", "nl": "<p>Holmenkollen staat als het spirituele thuis van <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">schansspringen</a> en <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">Noordse skiën</a>. Net buiten Oslo gelegen, is deze locatie al meer dan een eeuw centraal in de Noorse skicultuur.</p><h2>Historische betekenis</h2><p>Het eerste Holmenkollen skifestival werd gehouden in 1892.</p>", "ar": "<p>يعد هولمنكولين الموطن الروحي لـ<a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">القفز على الجليد</a> و<a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">التزلج الشمالي</a>. يقع خارج أوسلو مباشرة، وكان هذا الموقع محورياً في ثقافة التزلج النرويجية لأكثر من قرن.</p><h2>الأهمية التاريخية</h2><p>أقيم أول مهرجان للتزلج في هولمنكولين عام 1892.</p>", "ja": "<p>ホルメンコーレンは、<a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">スキージャンプ</a>と<a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">ノルディックスキー</a>の精神的な故郷として立っています。オスロ郊外に位置するこの会場は、1世紀以上にわたりノルウェーのスキー文化の中心でした。</p><h2>歴史的意義</h2><p>最初のホルメンコーレンスキーフェスティバルは1892年に開催されました。</p>", "zh": "<p>Holmenkollen shi <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">huaxue tiaoyue</a> he <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">beiou huaxue</a> de jingshen jiayuan. Weiyue Aosilu jiaowai, zhe ge changguan yibainianuo nian lai yizhi shi Nuowei huaxue wenhua de zhongxin.</p><h2>Lishi yiyi</h2><p>Diyi jie Holmenkollen huaxue jie yu 1892 nian juxing.</p>", "ko": "<p>홀멘콜렌은 <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">스키점프</a>와 <a href=\"/cross-country-skiing-guide/\">노르딕 스키</a>의 정신적 고향으로 서 있습니다. 오슬로 교외에 위치한 이 경기장은 한 세기 이상 노르웨이 스키 문화의 중심이었습니다.</p><h2>역사적 의의</h2><p>첫 번째 홀멘콜렌 스키 페스티벌은 1892년에 개최되었습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'venue-guide',
    'SJ',
    '{"en": "Holmenkollen venue guide - Oslo''s iconic ski jumping hill and Nordic skiing center, hosting competitions for over 130 years of Norwegian skiing tradition.", "de": "Holmenkollen Venue Guide - Oslos ikonische Skisprungschanze und Nordisches Skizentrum.", "fr": "Guide du site de Holmenkollen - Tremplin de saut à ski emblématique d''Oslo et centre de ski nordique.", "it": "Guida alla sede di Holmenkollen - Iconico trampolino di Oslo e centro di sci nordico.", "es": "Guía del lugar de Holmenkollen - Icónico trampolín de salto de esquí de Oslo y centro de esquí nórdico.", "pt": "Guia do local de Holmenkollen - Icônica rampa de salto de esqui de Oslo e centro de esqui nórdico.", "nl": "Holmenkollen locatiegids - Oslo''s iconische schans en Noordse ski centrum.", "ar": "دليل موقع هولمنكولين - منصة القفز على الجليد الأيقونية في أوسلو ومركز التزلج الشمالي", "ja": "ホルメンコーレン会場ガイド - オスロの象徴的なスキージャンプ台とノルディックスキーセンター", "zh": "Holmenkollen changguan zhinan - Aosilu de biaozhixing huaxue tiaoyue tai he beiou huaxue zhongxin", "ko": "홀멘콜렌 경기장 가이드 - 오슬로의 상징적인 스키점프대와 노르딕 스키 센터"}'::jsonb,
